dana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> l </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_knowhow/house_3/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">배의종류</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"maroon\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/ball.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                            무기,방어구 \n                            관련정보</b></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_knowhow/uo_knowhow_mw/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">매직</span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">옵션정보</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_knowhow/uo_knowhow_mw_6/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">매직효과표</font></a></span><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;l \n                            </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_knowhow/uo_knowhow_mw_7/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">방호구기본셋</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                            l </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_knowhow/uo_knowhow_mw_3/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">재료보너스</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> l&nbsp;</span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_knowhow/uo_knowhow_mw_4/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=